From 2afd97840908f07853b3525853d0d7ba59631950 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@example.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(account-usage): fresh usage with quota left lifts a
 stale quota bench [daveey]

A Codex usage_limit_reached benched the credential until the provider's
reset time, even after the subscription was reset early: routing skipped
the account and the usage chip stayed red with 0% weekly use.

- agent/account_usage_recovery.py: clear a bench only when it is a
  usage/quota reason code (not billing, auth or a plain 429), the snapshot
  is for the same account and was fetched after the bench, and every
  account-scoped window is below 100%. Telemetry never sets a bench.
- account_usage_cache._refresh_entries runs the check after each
  per-account fetch (the picker path).
- tui_gateway starts a 10-minute watch that re-fetches usage for
  quota-benched accounts only, so recovery is seen with no picker open.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
